WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.868
Meanwhile, with all the news

00:00:01.868 --> 00:00:02.901
about shifting mask guidelines,

00:00:02.901 --> 00:00:03.801
it's time to play the game

00:00:03.801 --> 00:00:04.601
that's sweeping the nation...

00:00:08.667 --> 00:00:10.734
♪♪
[ Applause ]

00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:13.667
This is the game where we pick
a random audience member

00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:16.501
and guess if there's a stache

00:00:16.501 --> 00:00:19.534
[ Laughter and applause ]
under their mask.

00:00:19.534 --> 00:00:22.801
So please welcome tonight's
audience member, Kevin Sproul.

00:00:22.801 --> 00:00:23.868
Kevin, where are you?

00:00:23.868 --> 00:00:25.567
♪♪

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:28.567
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:28.567 --> 00:00:32.934
♪♪

00:00:32.934 --> 00:00:34.968
Nice to see you, Kevin.

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:37.334
Kevin, thank you for being
on "The Tonight Show."

00:00:37.334 --> 00:00:38.400
Kevin, where are you from?

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.234
-San Diego.
-San Diego.

00:00:40.234 --> 00:00:41.667
That's all I can ask you.

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:42.968
[ Laughter ]
Alright, now, we have

00:00:42.968 --> 00:00:46.400
to figure out if you've got
a stache under that mask.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:47.300
Wait, hold on.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:48.234
Quest, you go first.

00:00:48.234 --> 00:00:49.701
You can ask him one question

00:00:49.701 --> 00:00:52.367
and then you must
make your guess.

00:00:52.367 --> 00:00:54.033
-Alright.
-Think hard.

00:00:54.033 --> 00:00:55.701
You only get one.
-I got one.

00:00:55.701 --> 00:01:00.734
-Okay. Kevin. Okay.
-Okay, so, at dinner,

00:01:00.734 --> 00:01:03.567
how many napkins
are you likely to use?

00:01:03.567 --> 00:01:05.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.167 --> 00:01:08.000
I'm actually an exceptionally
clean eater,

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:11.234
so I usually
only use one napkin.

00:01:11.234 --> 00:01:12.934
-Mm.
Tricky.

00:01:12.934 --> 00:01:13.834
[ Murmuring ]

00:01:13.834 --> 00:01:15.467
[ Laughter ]
Mm.

00:01:15.467 --> 00:01:18.200
-Are you going to guess now?

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:19.567
Or are you going to save it?

00:01:19.567 --> 00:01:21.667
-Oh, okay.
I'll guess now.

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:23.534
I think he has a stache.

00:01:23.534 --> 00:01:24.968
I think he's trying to trap me.

00:01:24.968 --> 00:01:26.934
-Okay. Okay.
He said one napkin. Okay.

00:01:26.934 --> 00:01:28.467
Higgins, your turn.
What's your question?

00:01:28.467 --> 00:01:29.167
-Hmm.

00:01:29.167 --> 00:01:33.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.033 --> 00:01:34.901
-San Diego, again?
-San Diego.

00:01:34.901 --> 00:01:36.300
-San Diego, California?

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:38.167
-Indeed.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.167 --> 00:01:39.534
-Got it.
That's my question.

00:01:39.534 --> 00:01:40.901
-That almost counts
as a question.

00:01:40.901 --> 00:01:43.901
That can't be your question.
Is San Diego in California

00:01:43.901 --> 00:01:45.133
is the question.
-Is it in California?

00:01:45.133 --> 00:01:46.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.367 --> 00:01:48.701
Does it take you, now,
the same amount of time

00:01:48.701 --> 00:01:50.767
as it always has to shave?

00:01:50.767 --> 00:01:51.634
-Yes.

00:01:53.868 --> 00:01:55.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:57.567
-Pff!
I'm going to say

00:01:57.567 --> 00:01:59.634
no stache.

00:01:59.634 --> 00:02:01.334
-Yeah!
-Yeah. Okay.

00:02:01.334 --> 00:02:03.400
Okay. Okay. My turn.

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:04.767
-It's in California.

00:02:04.767 --> 00:02:06.167
-Thank you.
No, that's not my question.

00:02:06.167 --> 00:02:09.400
[ Laughter ]
Okay. Okay.

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:10.634
San Diego.

00:02:10.634 --> 00:02:12.601
You look like
a clean-cut dude to me.

00:02:12.601 --> 00:02:14.501
Alright, here's my question.

00:02:14.501 --> 00:02:19.634
Do people mistake you for

00:02:19.634 --> 00:02:21.434
Burt Reynolds
or Timothée Chalamet?

00:02:21.434 --> 00:02:24.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.033 --> 00:02:26.767
-I would say the most I get is

00:02:26.767 --> 00:02:27.868
the Buddha.

00:02:27.868 --> 00:02:29.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.334 --> 00:02:30.601
-Ah!

00:02:30.601 --> 00:02:31.834
-Buddha was cleanshaven.

00:02:31.834 --> 00:02:34.834
Buddha is cleanshaven,
is what I think.

00:02:34.834 --> 00:02:37.734
You say no stache.
-I say no stache.

00:02:37.734 --> 00:02:39.300
-Quest?
-I say stache.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:41.167
-You say stache.
-Yes.

00:02:41.167 --> 00:02:43.601
-Gosh! I'm getting this vibe
of no stache.

00:02:43.601 --> 00:02:45.067
I think he's a clean-cut dude.

00:02:45.067 --> 00:02:46.267
I think no stache.

00:02:46.267 --> 00:02:47.434
It's time to find out...

00:02:47.434 --> 00:02:51.200
-...is there a stache
under that mask?

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:52.968
[ Drumroll ]

00:02:52.968 --> 00:02:54.100
-Ah!

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:56.501
[ Rimshot ]
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:56.501 --> 00:02:57.968
Oh.

00:02:57.968 --> 00:02:59.734
That's not bad. Thank you, man.
I appreciate it.

00:02:59.734 --> 00:03:02.133
Oh, wait, Kevin!
I'm sorry.

00:03:02.133 --> 00:03:04.300
Thank you for playing.
Of course, here,

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:06.634
you've won a two-week supply
of Turtle Wax.

00:03:06.634 --> 00:03:08.901
[ Laughter and applause ]
-There you go.
-Turtle Wax.

00:03:08.901 --> 00:03:10.767
When you're here, you're family.

00:03:10.767 --> 00:03:12.167
[ Laughter ]
Thank you for playing, bud.

00:03:12.167 --> 00:03:14.367
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:03:14.367 --> 00:03:16.400
Wow!
Stache.

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:18.701
[ Rimshot ]

00:03:18.701 --> 00:03:20.400
-He knew. He knew.
-Yeah, looks good,

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.467
looks good, looks good.

